# Autopilot — Wahy Wa Namaa

When working autonomously or on scheduled runs:
1. Read `AGENTS.md` and pick the first `pending` backlog item only.
2. Do not touch `platform/` unless the task explicitly targets V2.
3. Run the frontend build and backend syntax checks before finishing.
4. Push to `master`; native Vercel Git Integration deploys frontend and API.
5. Verify `https://wahy-wa-namaa-api.vercel.app/api/readiness` returns ready.
6. Mark the backlog item `done` in `AGENTS.md`.
7. Reply in Arabic, concise.

Current V1 stack: React 19 + Vite | Express 5 + MongoDB Atlas | portable object storage | Vercel runtime adapter.
